@startuml
!include _common/style.puml
title message-component 二期可靠发送状态总览
hide empty description

[*] --> PREPARE
PREPARE --> REJECTED : validate/enrich/resolve failed
PREPARE --> FAILED : serialize failed
PREPARE --> SEND_READY : PreparedMessageSend built

SEND_READY --> DIRECT_SEND : reliability disabled
SEND_READY --> RELIABLE_SEND : reliability enabled

DIRECT_SEND --> CONFIRMED : provider confirmed
DIRECT_SEND --> FAILED : provider failed
DIRECT_SEND --> REJECTED : provider rejected
DIRECT_SEND --> UNKNOWN : timeout / unknown

RELIABLE_SEND --> ATTEMPTING : RetryExecution created
ATTEMPTING --> CLASSIFY : ProviderSendResult
CLASSIFY --> CONFIRMED : CONFIRMED -> SUCCESS
CLASSIFY --> ATTEMPTING : retryable FAILED -> RETRY and backoff
CLASSIFY --> REJECTED : REJECTED -> STOP
CLASSIFY --> UNKNOWN : UNKNOWN + retryWhenUnknown=false
CLASSIFY --> FAILED : non-retryable FAILED / retry error
CLASSIFY --> RETRY_EXHAUSTED : attempts/duration exhausted

RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> FAILED : last result FAILED
RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> UNKNOWN : last result UNKNOWN

CONFIRMED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
UNKNOWN --> [*]
@enduml
